name annee-scolaire
category Package
revision 55988
shortdesc Automatically typeset the academic year (French way)
longdesc This package provides a macro \anneescolaire to automatically
longdesc write the academic year in the French way, according to the
longdesc date of compilation, two other macros to obtain the first and
longdesc the second calendar year of the academic year, a macro to be
longdesc redefined to change the presentation of the years.
